NB.*SelectNonemptyReviews v-- select nonempty Goodreads reviews.
NB.
NB. monad:  btcl =. SelectNonemptyReviews btclGoodTxt

NB. fetch selected columns for nonempty reviews.
dat=. }. y [ hd =. 0 { y
b=. 0 < #&> dat {"1~ hd i. <'My Review'
