bibkeys=:3 : 0

NB.*bibkeys v-- extract bibtex keys and titles from bibtex files.
NB.
NB. monad:  btcl =. bibkeys clBib
NB. 
NB.   bib=. read utf8 jpath '~LEAN/leanelements/gsbtex1/leanelements.bib'
NB.   cks=. bibkeys bib
NB.
NB.   NB. TAB delimited text of cite/type/title
NB.   (toHOST fmttd cks) write jpath '~temp/citations.txt'

NB. cut references ignoring preamble
bib=. ('@' E. y) <;.1 y

NB. document type
dtype=. }.@('{'&beforestr)&.> bib

NB. citation keys assigned by macos bibdesk program
