NB.
NB.   blogimgs posts  NB. see (ptableFrwpxml)

if. 0=#y do. 0 3$'' return. end.

NB. cut CDATA on <img's
txt=. ;(cdatatext&.> 5 {"1 y) ,&.> LF 
cimg=. ('>'&beforestr) &.> ( <'<img ' E. txt) <;.1 txt

NB. form table of titles and src urls
