NB. cut on urls
ctex=. ('\href{http' E. y) <;.1 y

NB. extract urls and some following text
ctex=. 2&{. &> (firstones&.> +/\&.> ((-@('}'&=)) + '{'&=)&.> ctex) <;.1&.> ctex
ctex=. ((0 {"1 ctex) -.&.> <'{}') ,. '{'&afterstr @ ('}'&beforestr) &.> 1 {"1 ctex

NB. retain only unique urls - trailing /s are immaterial
ctex=. ctex #~ ~: tslash2&.> 0 {"1 ctex

NB. replace CR,LR,TAB chars with blanks in text column
(0 {"1 ctex) ,.~ reb@((CR,' ',LF,' ',TAB,' ')&charsub)&.> 1 {"1 ctex
)

